 5ApCw\n\nJoin us on December 2nd\, 12-1pm PT to hear from Dr. Eduardo Bung
 e\, Ph.D. about "Enhancing Parent-Led Interventions Through Artificial Int
 elligence." \n\nThis presentation will summarize a growing body of researc
 h on ParenteAI and Pat\, a generative AI conversational agent designed to 
 complement evidence-based Parent Management Training (PMT). Previous studi
 es have examined treatment fidelity\, feasibility\, acceptability\, user e
 ngagement\, satisfaction\, and therapeutic alliance. Preliminary findings 
 indicate high adherence to PMT components\, substantial caregiver engageme
 nt\, and high satisfaction. An initial pilot study found significant reduc
 tions in child behavioral problems and parental depression\, anxiety\, and
  stress. Subsequent studies provided additional evidence supporting the fe
 asibility and acceptability of integrating Pat into therapist-led group PM
 T. The presentation will also share findings from a preregistered randomiz
 ed controlled trial (RCT) comparing therapist-led group PMT supplemented b
 y Pat with the same intervention delivered without AI support.
END:VEVENT
